{{!--
    Round: The Audience Decides. The audience is an array of objects, and each one votes at
    random. Most votes wins, and if there's a tie, Doris in the front row has the casting vote.
--}}

[[The Audience Decides]]:
@set audience = [{ name: "Doris", seat: "the front row" }, { name: "Gary", seat: "row C, asleep" }, { name: "Cardboard Steve", seat: "the aisle" }]
@set votes = []
"THE AUDIENCE DECIDES!" Hank waves grandly at the audience. "Ladies and gentlemen and cardboard: what challenge should {{player_name}} face?"

{{#each audience}}
- **{{name}}**, in {{seat}}, votes {{random (array "SING" "DANCE" "BLENDER") set="vote"}}{{append "votes" vote}}{{#if @last}} (nobody knows how){{/if}}
{{/each}}

{{#if (count votes "SING") >= 2}}{{set "challenge" "SING"}}{{else if (count votes "DANCE") >= 2}}{{set "challenge" "DANCE"}}{{else if (count votes "BLENDER") >= 2}}{{set "challenge" "BLENDER"}}{{else}}{{set "challenge" (first votes)}}"A tie! Doris has the casting vote!"{{/if}}

{{#if challenge = "SING"}}
"You heard them! SING, {{player_name}}! Sing like your points depend on it! Because they do!"

[[Sing beautifully]]

[[Sing terribly, on purpose]]
{{else if challenge = "DANCE"}}
"DANCE! Show us your moves!"

[[Dance like nobody's watching]]

[[Do the robot]]
{{else}}
"An impression of a BLENDER! This is normal television!"

[[WHIRRRRRR]]

[[Refuse, on grounds of dignity]]
{{/if}}

[[Sing beautifully]]:
@sound sounds/applause.mp3
@inc score 150
You belt out an operatic version of the show's theme tune, making up the words as you go.

The audience is moved. Gary wakes up specially to applaud. 150 points!

{{#animate "toast"}}STANDING OVATION!{{/animate}}

[[Next round!]](next round)

[[Sing terribly, on purpose]]:
@dec patience
@inc score 25
You screech like a cat in a tumble dryer. On purpose. For art.

Hank: "That was... really something. Twenty-five points. Moving on. Quickly."

[[Next round!]](next round)

[[Dance like nobody's watching]]:
@sound sounds/applause.mp3
@inc score 125
{{#style "sway"}}You dance like nobody's watching.{{/style}} Everybody is watching. There are cameras.

Cardboard Steve falls over, but approvingly. 125 points!

[[Next round!]](next round)

[[Do the robot]]:
@inc score 100
You do the robot so convincingly that a stagehand tries to unplug you.

{{#animate "toast"}}BEEP BOOP. 100 POINTS.{{/animate}}

[[Next round!]](next round)

[[WHIRRRRRR]]:
@sound sounds/applause.mp3
@inc score 175
{{#style "shudder"}}You spin round, making blender noises.{{/style}} It's deeply unsettling. Doris asks if you do smoothies.

Professor Boom's voice echoes up from under the stage: "MAGNIFICENT!" 175 points!

[[Next round!]](next round)

[[Refuse, on grounds of dignity]]:
@dec patience
"I'm not doing that."

Hank: "Fair enough. You keep your dignity, and your score stays exactly where it is."

[[Next round!]](next round)
